<title>USA: US Stockpile sells 580 tonnes tin at $2.72125/lb.</title>
<headline>US Stockpile sells 580 tonnes tin at $2.72125/lb.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Defense Logistics Agency said it sold 580 tonnes of stockpile tin at its daily offering Tuesday to three firms at a unit price of $2.72125 per lb.</p>
<p>The DLA sold 200 tonnes of tin to RMT Metals of New York, N.Y. and 200 tonnes to Considar, also of New York, N.Y.</p>
<p>It sold the remaining 180 tonnes to American Iron &amp; Metal of Quebec, Canada.</p>
